From b64d108ee5a3ccb4609d082dc7b7b85b97af3d8e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Otavio Salvador <otavio@ossystems.com.br>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 08:00:08 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 07/11] feat(server): worktree setup scripts start with the
 direnv environment

A new Load direnv environment setup stage evaluates the worktree's approved .envrc before the
setup script, so projects no longer need a direnv allow setup script. A failure is shown on the
stage and setup continues.
